# Raw test logs are retained on disk so a failed coverage run can be diagnosed
# (that retention is the fix for QA-004 — the script used to delete its own log
# and destroyed the evidence for FLAKE-1). They are not committed: the log for a
# full-suite run is close to a megabyte of mostly "ok" lines and would churn the
# repository on every run.
#
# The committed evidence is the derived artifact: coverage-baseline.json and
# coverage-baseline.md. When a log matters beyond the local machine, quote the
# relevant excerpt into the finding instead of committing the whole file.
coverage-test.log
coverage.profile
